### Spearman correlations between relative StimON versus StimOFF differences of the MDS-UPDRS III or mean reaction time in the MOT and CANTAB relative StimONOFF-Differences
    
NONPAR CORR
  /VARIABLES=UPDRSIII_relDiff_OffOn tremor_relDiff_OffOn rigidity_relDiff_OffOn bradykinesia_relDiff_OffOn MOTML_relDiff_OffOn RTISMDRT_relDiff_OffOn 
    RTIFMDRT_relDiff_OffOn RTISMDMT_relDiff_OffOn RTIFMDMT_relDiff_OffOn MTTLMD_relDiff_OffOn
  /PRINT=SPEARMAN TWOTAIL NOSIG FULL
  /MISSING=PAIRWISE.


